{298}{This be the Shire of Brandybuck. There's not too much to tell really, other than having the honor of being the largest community of halflings in the Southlands. Ever since Leahbo started letting all the long-shanks live there, they can't claim to be a halfling shire anymore. It's just a fishing town theses days. And we produce the softest wool in all of Arcanum. As soft as Elven Silk it is! }{This be the Shire of Brandybuck. There's not too much to tell really, other than having the honor of being the largest community of halflings in the Southlands. Ever since Leahbo started letting all the long-shanks live there, they can't claim to be a halfling shire anymore. It's just a fishing town theses days. And we produce the softest wool in all of Arcanum. As soft as Elven Silk it is! }{}{}{}{ru 2224}
{299}{Thank you. The softest wool. That's nice to know. Would you be good enough to show me where Leahbo is?}{}{5}{}{301}{ru 2225}
