{320}{Oh, him. That's Farmer Maggot. He grows the finest potatoes in all the shire, and it seems every vagabond in the world knows about it. Every year most of his crop gets stolen. You'd do well to give him a wide berth, my boy, as he's out to make sure no one steals any this year. }{Oh, him. That's Farmer Maggot. He grows the finest potatoes in all the shire, and it seems every vagabond in the world knows about it. Every year most of his crop gets stolen. You'd do well to give him a wide berth, my dear, as he's out to make sure no one steals any this year. }{}{}{}{ru 2222}
